{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53933","headline":"奉赠河西真法师 · 栖白","name":"奉赠河西真法师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知师远自炖煌至，艺行兼通释与儒。\n还似法兰与上国，仍论博望献新图。\n已闻[□]陇春长在，更说河湟草不枯。\n郡去五天多少地，丕腾得见雪山无。\n（见伯三八八六卷。\n原署：「京荐福寺内供奉大德栖白上。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}